Reference data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

data/reference/tag_map.csv is derived in part from the Codifier of
Administrative-Territorial Units and Territories of Territorial Communities
(KATOTTG / КАТОТТГ), published by the Ministry of Development of Communities and
Territories of Ukraine on the Ukrainian open data portal:

  https://data.gov.ua/dataset/43c2a113-a032-4c8a-a409-3b5e1660bb38

Published under Creative Commons Attribution. Reuse is permitted, including
commercially, on condition that the source is cited, which this notice does.

The file also contains counts measured from the public Telegram channel
t.me/s/air_alert_ua, and a status and note column recording where the two
vocabularies disagree. Those columns are this project's own work.
